color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F15.20.7a5cc9\">15.20.7a5cc9</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 24, 2025<br/>Winter Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20260501200925&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jade_Dragon_Head_Charged_4be0ac.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a jade dragon head.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 4.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A talisman, imbued with ancient magic, now in full power.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest\">The Roost of the Graveborn Quest</a>. After finishing the quest, using the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Jade%20Dragon%20Head\"><img alt=\"Jade Dragon Head\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jade_Dragon_Head_62a7ce.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jade%20Dragon%20Head\">Jade Dragon Head</a> will transform it into this charged version. It can be used with a cooldown of 14 days, granting one <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancestral%20Charge\">Ancestral Charge</a> and one <a href=\"#/wiki/Favour%20of%20the%20Ancients\">Favour of the Ancients</a>, and becoming an <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Inert%20Dragon%20Head\"><img alt=\"Inert Dragon Head\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Inert_Dragon_Head_2a2b7e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Inert%20Dragon%20Head\">Inert Dragon Head</a>. The following messages will show up:\n</p>\n<ul><li>On success: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You have gained Ancestral Charges and Favour of the Ancients!</span></li>\n<li>On failure: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">It is too early to use this again!</span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div clas